Apa?

1654
01:35:28,013 --> 01:35:29,265
Sepertinya, dia gila.

1655
01:35:29,348 --> 01:35:32,351
Kau egois, Nn. Manuel.

1656
01:35:33,185 --> 01:35:37,106
Kalau kau pergi
dan kembali ke kehidupan lamamu,

1657
