1674
01:36:44,089 --> 01:36:46,926
Aku mohon!

1675
01:36:49,845 --> 01:36:52,223
Aku mohon, Tuhan!

1676
01:36:55,142 --> 01:36:56,769
Ya, Tuhan!

1677
01:36:58,103 --> 01:36:59,980
Aku mohon, Tuhan!

1678
