Kumat lagi, ya?

1702
01:38:53,302 --> 01:38:56,263
Justin baik-baik saja. Dia kuat.
Seperti Ibu.

1703
01:38:56,347 --> 01:38:57,765
Ya?

1704
01:38:57,848 --> 01:38:58,849
Aku pulang cepat.

1705
